{
  "sn12.28:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 12.28 ",
  "sn12.28:0.2": "3. Dasabalavagga ",
  "sn12.28:0.3": "Bhikkhusutta ",
  "sn12.28:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ viharati. ",
  "sn12.28:1.2": "“Tatra kho …pe… ",
  "sn12.28:1.3": "idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu jarāmaraṇaṁ pajānāti, jarāmaraṇasamudayaṁ pajānāti, jarāmaraṇanirodhaṁ pajānāti, jarāmaraṇanirodhagāminiṁ paṭipadaṁ pajānāti, jātiṁ pajānāti …pe… ",
  "sn12.28:1.4": "bhavaṁ pajānāti … ",
  "sn12.28:1.5": "upādānaṁ pajānāti … ",
  "sn12.28:1.6": "taṇhaṁ pajānāti … ",
  "sn12.28:1.7": "vedanaṁ pajānāti … ",
  "sn12.28:1.8": "phassaṁ pajānāti … ",
  "sn12.28:1.9": "saḷāyatanaṁ pajānāti … ",
  "sn12.28:1.10": "nāmarūpaṁ pajānāti … ",
  "sn12.28:1.11": "viññāṇaṁ pajānāti … ",
  "sn12.28:1.12": "saṅkhāre pajānāti, saṅkhārasamudayaṁ pajānāti, saṅkhāranirodhaṁ pajānāti, saṅkhāranirodhagāminiṁ paṭipadaṁ pajānāti. ",
  "sn12.28:2.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, jarāmaraṇaṁ? ",
  "sn12.28:2.2": "Yā tesaṁ tesaṁ sattānaṁ tamhi tamhi sattanikāye jarā jīraṇatā khaṇḍiccaṁ pāliccaṁ valittacatā āyuno saṁhāni indriyānaṁ paripāko—",
  "sn12.28:2.3": "ayaṁ vuccati jarā. ",
  "sn12.28:2.4": "Yā tesaṁ tesaṁ sattānaṁ tamhā tamhā sattanikāyā cuti cavanatā bhedo antaradhānaṁ maccu maraṇaṁ kālakiriyā khandhānaṁ bhedo kaḷevarassa nikkhepo; ",
  "sn12.28:2.5": "idaṁ vuccati maraṇaṁ. ",
  "